; The plain case: a couple of accounts and money moving between them.
option "title" "Simple"
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2023-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking USD
2023-01-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances
2023-01-01 open Income:Salary USD
2023-01-01 open Expenses:Rent USD

2023-01-01 * "Opening"
  Assets:Bank:Checking   1000.00 USD
  Equity:Opening-Balances

2023-01-25 * "Employer Inc" "January salary"
  Assets:Bank:Checking   4321.55 USD
  Income:Salary

2023-02-01 * "Landlord" "February rent"
  Assets:Bank:Checking  -1450.00 USD
  Expenses:Rent          1450.00 USD

2023-03-01 balance Assets:Bank:Checking  3871.55 USD
